3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"PAYDAY: Aces High - Demo is out NOW!🔥","summary":"Welcome Heisters!The vault has opened and the flood of playtesters are joining in to start plotting their revenge on Warren Jupiter. Take part in the familiar Flowtrust Bank along with a brand new location of a Cosmopolitan Museum of Art. How will you go about it - the stealthy Clubs way or guns blazing Spades way? Your choice. Other than that, we are very proud to announce the official release date of the full version of PAYDAY: Aces High! It will come out on both Steam and Meta on November 5th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691363","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1846651706678198","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"PAYDAY: Aces High - Masks Showcase 🎭","summary":"Welcome Heisters!Aces High has more masks to offer than just the main Aces - let's take a look, shall we?Quick reminder that EVERYONE taking part in the upcoming Open Playtest WILL be getting the Kitty Mask for FREE! All the masks in order:UnwitnessedPizzaSeedy SamLe FantomeVicious WarriorThe CapoHellspeakLong FaceHard TimeLaugh RiotThe Kitty (FREE FOR ALL PLAYTESTERS!)Dishonest AbeGoalieSmokeyMasque De FerThe OGMonkey BusinessDeco 1925The ShroudMiss EmptyMr EmptyMaikoOld BobCallous Cupid What i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:31:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678198","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1845383656378426","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"PAYDAY: Aces High - Aces Unmasked ❤️♠️♦️♣️","summary":"Welcome Heisters!You may know the Aces for their masks, but what hides underneath them? Well, check it out! Who is your favourite Ace so far? Let us know! Don't miss the upcoming October 19th Demo - wishlist now! Join our Discord for latest news and playtests!https://discord.com/invite/5gpXpSDugM Follow us on other Social Media channelshttps://linktr.ee/paydayaceshigh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T17:12:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378426","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1844751498219870","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Demo coming Oct 19!","summary":"PAYDAY: Aces High is joining Steam Next Fest on Oct 19 with a demo!You'll be able to try TWO of the heists from the full game. Playing the demo also unlocks an exclusive Kitty Mask for you in the full game as it launches later this year. 💥Wishlist the game today and get notified when the demo is live!Please also be aware that while the game is close to going gold, we're is still working hard to get everything 100% ready for launch. We'll be monitoring performance and gathering data from the demo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T00:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219870","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1842212951296755","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"PAYDAY: Aces High is coming to Steam Frame!","summary":"Hi Aces and other Heisters! We're excited to announce that PAYDAY: Aces High is being developed for Steam Frame! Take your heisting skills to the next level on the new wireless VR headset from Valve.It’s the same version on the Steam store as the SteamVR version, so make sure to WISHLIST the game today and get ready to play Aces High the way YOU want to!Wishlist PAYDAY Aces High now! ❤️♠️♦️♣️If you want to find other players or get more info, be sure to join our Discord channels https://discord.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T12:34:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296755","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1841579228677266","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for playtesting!","summary":"❤️ THANK YOU FOR PLAYTESTING PAYDAY: ACES HIGH ❤️The weekend was INCREDIBLE and we couldn't have hoped for a better community.We want to thank everyone who took their time to sign-up, playtest the game and leave us some feedback - this will prove invaluable in further development!Playtest in numbers:7456 total Heisters💸400+ unique feedback reports ✍️0 crossplay friends (apologies) 😭Fastest Stealth Overkill Speedrun by Hertage in just 2:48 🏃1 million Jupiter's Ledgers stolen (probably) 💰We want t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T04:45:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1841579228665290","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"Try PAYDAY: Aces High today!","summary":"Try PAYDAY: Aces High today in our very first closed playtest!💥Join on the store page. The spots are limited so get in early. The playtest ends Aug 24.This is the first time we let anyone outside the studio play the game, so there will likely be some bugs etc. Some of our known issues are:The Safe House is in a very early stage of development and a lot of things, especially visuals, will be added and changed in the near future. For now, it’s only there as a lobby roomSometimes AI Teammates may r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T12:01:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665290","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1840944183777676","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"Stealing Candy from a Billionaire + Closed Playtests 🔥🔥🔥","summary":"Welcome Heisters! Stealing candy from a billionaire is Aces' favorite hobby. 🍬 💸Today we have 2 exciting pieces of news! New trailer drop! This time, we will be taking a look at some gameplay from one of the runs of our Museum Heist called Stealing Candy from a Billionaire! 🔥🔥🔥CLOSED PLAYTESTS SIGN-UPS🔥🔥🔥 Yep, you heard right! You can go on our Steam Page and request access to the closed playtest that STARTS AUG 20!If you want to find other players or get more info, be sure to join our Discord c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T19:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1840310314341989","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"PAYDAY: Aces High - VR Games Showcase🃏","summary":"Welcome Heisters!You CAN'T miss next week's VR Games Showcase - Aces will be there and high! 11am PT, Thursday Aug 13. See you there: https://buff.ly/IWz1BXL ♣️ Playtests Soon♣️We are coming back to something we haven't revelead outright, but now we are confirming it! There will be opportunities to play the game before it launches later in 2026. Prospering Aces should join the PAYDAY Discord server through the link below and get their Aces High roles ASAP - we cannot say when, but we will be ope","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T13:51:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341989","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1835871199316498","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"PAYDAY: Aces High - Developer Direct + New Information! 🃏","summary":"Welcome Heisters! The team from VR Games Showcase visited our studios to record this Developer Direct. We thought it would be a good opportunity to share some exciting news about PAYDAY: Aces High and its future! So, let's get on it! ❤️ Developer Direct ❤️First of all, if you haven't already, please go watch the full Developer Direct where you can hear more about developing this very ambitious projects from our team members! ♠️ Free DLC Post Launch ♠️You heard right - we are geraing up to seriuo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T18:57:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199316498","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3456660-1831432155565233","game_id":"steam-3456660","kind":"announcement","title":"PAYDAY: Aces High - Meet the Aces! ❤️♠️♦️♣️","summary":"Welcome Heisters! Today, we want to draw back the curtain a bit and talk more about the new gang - the Aces. You have seen them in action, but do you really know what they are all about? If you are interested, read on! THE MASTERMIND ❤️The crew works as a unit, but when they absolutely need a leader, The Mastermind is the one who steps in. No one has ever questioned this. He seems to be the best suited 